OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder after
OL,4,Awoman's body found in burning van
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter a woman's body was found in a
OL,8,Fburning van.
OL,10,FThomas Matthew Hammond Bell, of
OL,11,FWellington Road, Rhyl, appeared at
OL,12,FLlandudno Magistrates' Court on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FNorth Wales Police arrested the
OL,16,F38-year-old after emergency services
OL,17,Fhad been called to Gas Works Lane in
OL,18,FPrestatyn, Denbighshire, at about 23:30
OL,19,FBST on 4 October to deal with a van
OL,20,Ffire.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
